<item>
            <title>[LU-20933] sanity-quota test_7b: limit on lustre-OST0000 2052 &lt;= 2052</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20933</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity-quota test_7b failed once in review-dne-zfs-part-4 (el10.1 servers and clients, ZFS):&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/bf576440-ebd5-41b6-a4e3-9536914e98fa&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/bf576440-ebd5-41b6-a4e3-9536914e98fa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/71d784af-9756-489d-bb36-fefa84a18030&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/71d784af-9756-489d-bb36-fefa84a18030&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;sanity-quota test_7b: @@@@@@ FAIL: limit on lustre-OST0000 2052 &amp;lt;= 2052
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The test sets fail_loc=0xa02 (OBD_FAIL_QUOTA_EDQUOT) on the MDSs, enables OST quota, sets a 100000M hard limit, and writes a second 1M to the file. It saves the user&apos;s bhardlimit on OST0000, restarts ost1, waits for reintegration, and expects the limit to be larger.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In this run the second dd succeeded and the limit was 2052 before the restart and still 2052 after wait_ost_reint returned:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt; [dd] [if=/dev/urandom] [bs=1M] [of=/mnt/lustre/d7b.sanity-quota/f7b.sanity-quota] [count=1] [seek=1] [oflag=sync] [conv=notrunc]
1+0 records in
1+0 records out
-u quota_usr  bhardlimit:2052
Restart ost to trigger reintegration...
...
-u quota_usr  bhardlimit:2052
 sanity-quota test_7b: @@@@@@ FAIL: limit on lustre-OST0000 2052 &amp;lt;= 2052
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It is rare. In the last 45 days Maloo has 778 runs of this subtest in lustre-reviews: 777 pass, and this one failure.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The patch under test (&lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/68415&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/68415&lt;/a&gt; patch set 25) changes only lustre/utils, lustre/tests and documentation below it, no server or quota code, so the failure does not look related to it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
